# model-server/Dockerfile 전용 — 빌드 컨텍스트(저장소 루트)에서 필요한 파일만 허용한다.
*

!model-server/pyproject.toml
!model-server/uv.lock
!model-server/app/
!model-server/schemas/
!model-server/config.yaml
!model-server/models.lock.yaml
!shared/assertion-terms.json

!model-server/var/models/model3/serving_ordneg/*/config.json
!model-server/var/models/model3/serving_ordneg/*/model.safetensors
!model-server/var/models/model3/serving_ordneg/*/model_card.json
!model-server/var/models/model3/serving_ordneg/*/tokenizer.json
!model-server/var/models/model3/serving_ordneg/*/tokenizer_config.json

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
